  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Releases",
      "items": [
        "c2c_ui: npm version (major|minor|patch), then push with --follow-tags; CI refuses a tag that differs from package.json",
        "Every repository creates its GitHub release from the vX.Y.Z tag, with generated notes",
        "Images are tagged by docker/metadata-action with the branch or tag name",
        "Architecture docs: v6_api docs/ is served by GitHub Pages straight from master (no workflow)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Why the classic manifest",
      "items": [
        "The legacy hosts run Docker 1.12, which cannot pull an OCI index",
        "So every image is pushed with provenance: false and oci-mediatypes=false",
        "c2c_images and c2c_tracking check the published manifest after the push"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "PR previews",
      "items": [
        "Each c2c_ui branch is built for GitHub Pages; a PR preview waits for a maintainer in the pr-preview environment",
        "gh-pages-cleanup.yml removes the folder when the PR is merged or closed",
        "Previews are never deployed for forks or Dependabot"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Deploying",
      "items": [
        "Legacy: edit server-list.env (API_VERSION, also used by the workers) or the compose image tag, source it, then pull and up -d per VM with HAProxy draining",
        "API with a schema change: alembic upgrade head from api0 before recreating containers",
        "v7: ansible-playbook deploy.yml redeploys api, images, workers, ui and tracking; site.yml also does hardening, databases, certificates and monitoring",
        "Preview of a v6_api branch on preprod: -e preprod_api_version=<tag>, e.g. es8-preprod"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Bots and scheduled jobs",
      "items": [
        "Dependabot in every repository: weekly for the apps, monthly for infra (actions, Docker, compose, Terraform)",
        "Transifex: c2c_ui pushes its strings from master; c2c_ui and c2c_tracking pull translations every 6 h as a PR",
        "c2c_ui: browserslist update PR twice a month; Conventional Commit PR titles enforced",
        "CodeQL on v6_api, c2c_ui, c2c_images and c2c_tracking"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not drawn",
      "items": [
        "Codacy coverage upload and the coverage comment on tracking PRs",
        "infra CI also renders every host's .env and validates each v7 composition",
        "The legacy procedure in the wikis still names compose0; the bastion has replaced it"
      ]
    }
  ]
}